   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Syd Frame 2010-2012 inkl EU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework agreement 2010-2012 funds provided to Forum SYd for support to civil society organisations in developing countries, through       applying Swedish organisations. The contribution includes             administration costs and costs at Forum Syd level for the             sub-granting assignment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramst&#xf6;d till Forum Syd 2010-2012 f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till det civila samh&#xe4;llets  organisationer i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder, via svenska s&#xf6;kande               organisationer, Bidraget inkluderar anslag till Forum Syd f&#xf6;r         hantering av vidaref&#xf6;rmedling samt administrationsbidrag.</narrative>
  </description>
